<title>USA: DeGeorge breaks with auditor Price Waterhouse.</title>
<headline>DeGeorge breaks with auditor Price Waterhouse.</headline>
<dateline>CHESHIRE, Conn. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>DeGeorge Financial Corp said Monday it ended its 25-year client-auditor relationship with Price Waterhouse LLP on July 18.</p>
<p>A company statement said Price Waterhouse &quot;indicated no current disagreements with the company regarding its accounting principles or procedures.&quot;</p>
<p>DeGeorge's chief financial officer, Salvatore Bucci, said problems started after DeGeorge moved to Connecticut from Minneapolis in 1996.  </p>
<p>Bucci added he was &quot;disenchanted&quot; with the performance of the Price Waterhouse Connecticut offices he dealt with.</p>
<p>A Price Waterhouse spokesman was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
